# Pins line endings at the repo level instead of relying on each
# contributor's own core.autocrlf setting - this project is developed across
# both Windows and Linux, and everything committed so far is LF already.
# text=auto still lets git auto-detect genuinely binary files (icons, etc.)
# so they're never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit for the known binary assets, as a defense-in-depth backstop to
# text=auto's own content-sniffing.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
